Artwork provenance

assets/cat-rest.png, assets/cat-left.png, and assets/cat-right.png are copied from the default skin in luinbytes/bongocat: https://github.com/luinbytes/bongocat/tree/main/skins/default

assets/cat-both.png is generated locally from pixel changes in those three copied pose frames. No other third-party artwork is shipped in this plugin.

Original meme attribution

The upstream project describes its artwork as inspired by the original Bongo Cat meme: meme concept by DitzyFlama; original cat drawing by StrayRogue. This plugin is not affiliated with either creator.

